module-pdrouting (6.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * fix: remove trigger in one_to_many::stop() to prevent use-after-free
  * fix: prevent dangling pointer in pd_demux zero_copy mode
  * fix: call stop() from destructors if still started
  * fix: wrap tick() methods in try/catch for exception safety
  * fix: make start() exception-safe by deferring started flag
  * fix: warn on partial PD coverage and zero-fill mux tail bytes
  * fix: remove leftover debug printf in mux template parsing
  * fix: add template/map YAML support for one_to_many
  * fix: use size_t for pos in pd_mux::tick() to match length type
  * fix: correct 'reseting' typo to 'resetting' in log messages
  * fix: add .conanignore to exclude build artifacts from exports_sources
  * fix: remove dead pd_mux_merge class from header
  * fix: replace broken m4_ifdef with standard pkgconfigdir AC_SUBST
  * doc: fix mux outputs->inputs bug, document all config options
  * README: rework into structured reference document

